## When dual-host / freeze / catch-up / M5 / horeb is mentioned

1. **STOP** unrelated feature work.  
2. Run **`./scripts/dual-host-bootstrap.sh --agent`**.  
3. Follow `agent-context.md` + automation SSOT.  
4. Freeze still dirty multi-repo: claim `m5/*` or `horeb/*` → push → PR.  
5. No merge to `main` unless operator orders. No `reset --hard`. No delete `horeb/safety-park-*` unread.

## Develop / push / PR (always)

| Work | Action |
|------|--------|
| Leave machine or ship | claim branch → push → **PR** |
| End of day / switch host | **push required** |
| Direct commit to `main` | **Forbidden** (except operator-ordered hub maintenance) |
| Secrets / `target/` / huge binaries | **Never commit** |

